WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.143
Safex

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.995
Who is Albert?

00:00:04.145 --> 00:00:06.766
Why do you call me like this?

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:15.838
Mr. Albert has lost his memory.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:21.344
I will have to wait until
Mr. Albert remembers everything.

00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:23.988
Candy told herself.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:31.961
Two people's trial.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.953
Good morning, Mr. Albert.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.899
What is wrong, Mr. Albert?

00:01:14.049 --> 00:01:15.634
I don't know.

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:17.233
I can't remember anything.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:19.638
Which is my real name?

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.271
Who am I?

00:01:25.319 --> 00:01:28.180
Mr. Albert, please lie down on the bed.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:29.715
Mr. Albert?

00:01:29.865 --> 00:01:32.418
Isn't that your brother's name?

00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:36.086
Sorry.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.030
I didn't mean it.

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:43.028
Don't force yourself
to remember anything.

00:01:43.178 --> 00:01:45.732
You will remember about
the past naturally.

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:50.106
Thank you, Miss Candice.

00:01:50.711 --> 00:01:53.938
Just call me Candy.

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.000
Right, Candy.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.909
Have you taken your morning pills?

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.183
I have some dessert for you.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:03.916
That's plenty.

00:02:04.366 --> 00:02:07.459
Eating gives you more strength, right?

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.656
Thank you, Candy.

00:02:10.806 --> 00:02:12.028
Do you want to eat now?

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.766
Maybe later, I am tired.

00:02:15.836 --> 00:02:18.163
Have a good rest then.

00:02:18.313 --> 00:02:19.068
Ok.

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:29.442
Poope, be quiet.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.219
Poor Mr. Albert...

00:02:36.757 --> 00:02:39.624
I will help you remember everything.

00:02:40.861 --> 00:02:42.328
Yeah.

00:02:42.696 --> 00:02:45.221
I should let him meet Terry.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:49.167
Terry and Mr. Albert are good friends.

00:02:54.074 --> 00:02:57.168
Maybe that will help.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:14.217
Terry!

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:17.652
Anyone seen Terry?

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.158
He already left.

00:03:20.308 --> 00:03:21.700
Yeah?

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:25.497
He is a typical loner.

00:03:25.647 --> 00:03:27.833
He lives in an expensive place!

00:03:27.983 --> 00:03:29.899
He has so much money!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.303
He seems to be planning something.

00:03:33.647 --> 00:03:35.512
Not sure what he is busy with.

00:03:42.022 --> 00:03:44.917
Return ticket and accommodation.

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:47.157
All done.

00:03:50.664 --> 00:03:51.668
Come in.

00:03:52.132 --> 00:03:53.827
May I?

00:03:54.668 --> 00:03:58.069
Hello, it's something urgent.

00:03:58.338 --> 00:04:00.169
Sorry to disturb you.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:06.271
Here, I bought a cake on the way.

00:04:06.421 --> 00:04:08.106
It comes with the flowers.

00:04:08.256 --> 00:04:10.075
How did you find me?

00:04:10.325 --> 00:04:12.678
The troupe manager told me
where you are.

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:16.548
I thought your room would be a mess.

00:04:16.698 --> 00:04:18.316
But it's so clean!

00:04:18.766 --> 00:04:20.786
Speak! Didn't you say it's urgent?

00:04:20.936 --> 00:04:23.088
Aren't you going to treat me
with a cup of tea?

00:04:23.538 --> 00:04:28.730
Sorry, I don't have
anything here for a rich miss.

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:30.502
What is so urgent?

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:33.398
The next show is decided.

00:04:33.548 --> 00:04:35.634
Romeo and Juliet.

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:38.643
Romeo and Juliet...

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:42.272
An audition will be held soon.

00:04:42.422 --> 00:04:44.077
An audition?

00:04:45.385 --> 00:04:48.218
You are going to come, right, Terrius?

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:49.914
Sure.

00:04:50.364 --> 00:04:51.516
Me too.

00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:54.352
You will be Romeo, I will be Juliet.

00:04:54.502 --> 00:04:57.521
It's going to be so wonderful
if this works out!

00:05:07.573 --> 00:05:10.037
Let's start practicing tonight.

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.808
Terrius, where are you going?

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:20.012
To ask about the audition.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.221
Terrius, I will go with you!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.921
Terrius!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:35.123
Terrius, you are such a loner!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.197
Romeo and Juliet.

00:05:39.347 --> 00:05:41.299
If I could play the role of Romeo,

00:05:41.449 --> 00:05:43.633
Candy would come to Broadway to see me.

00:05:43.883 --> 00:05:45.776
That would be great.

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:48.272
The May Festival at St. Paul Academy...

00:05:48.422 --> 00:05:50.429
The Romeo and Juliet in my memory.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.514
Candy danced as Romeo.

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:57.447
And her beautiful Juliet dress...

00:06:09.802 --> 00:06:12.930
A year has passed since then.

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:31.580
- Miss Candice!
- Yes!

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:36.020
You have a letter.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.086
A letter?

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:45.501
It's from Terry!

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:56.475
I am preparing
for the next show's audition.

00:06:56.949 --> 00:06:58.409
If I get to play this role,

00:06:58.559 --> 00:07:01.180
I will invite you on Broadway.

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:04.515
I will invite you on Broadway.

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:06.250
Terry!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:11.419
You need to work hard
so that you could apply for a leave.

00:07:11.569 --> 00:07:14.694
"To a freckled angel."

00:07:15.234 --> 00:07:16.861
That's not funny!

00:07:19.972 --> 00:07:23.870
But, Terry wants
to invite me on Broadway...

00:07:25.678 --> 00:07:28.340
I wish I could be there right away.

00:07:33.519 --> 00:07:35.282
Miss Candice!

00:07:36.722 --> 00:07:40.049
Is climbing trees a course for nurses?

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:42.624
Vice-principal Leonard!

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:50.127
Does Merry Jane Nurse School
teach tree climbing?

00:07:50.377 --> 00:07:53.863
No, this is my hobby.

00:07:54.306 --> 00:07:57.571
I need to talk to you,
come down quick.

00:08:05.017 --> 00:08:07.244
The patient in ward no. 3...

00:08:07.394 --> 00:08:12.282
I have already swapped with the
nurse in charge of ward no. 0.

00:08:12.432 --> 00:08:18.316
What? How could you do that
without permission?

00:08:18.466 --> 00:08:21.990
I know that patient
and I wanted to take care of him.

00:08:26.004 --> 00:08:28.837
Candy, are you a qualified nurse?

00:08:29.941 --> 00:08:32.876
Only qualified nurses can take charge
of ward no. 0.

00:08:35.313 --> 00:08:37.274
Even if you know that patient,

00:08:37.424 --> 00:08:41.179
I can't leave him to a trainee.

00:08:41.853 --> 00:08:45.619
Please ask someone
who is qualified to help me!

00:08:46.124 --> 00:08:49.025
We need to follow the rules!

00:08:49.494 --> 00:08:53.189
Mr. Albert needs someone
caring to look after him!

00:08:53.539 --> 00:08:55.358
Candice! Since you insist,

00:08:55.508 --> 00:08:59.301
I hope you can pass the
nurse qualification test this month.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.034
If you become a qualified nurse,

00:09:04.184 --> 00:09:06.771
only then you can take charge
of ward No. 0.

00:09:06.978 --> 00:09:10.846
But I assume it would be
hard for you, wouldn't it?

00:09:12.717 --> 00:09:14.777
You are just an amateur.

00:09:14.927 --> 00:09:18.314
Violation of the hospital regulations
is not allowed!

00:09:18.464 --> 00:09:20.550
An amateur?

00:09:34.672 --> 00:09:36.765
How could he say that!

00:09:37.942 --> 00:09:42.936
But I have forgotten all about the test.

00:09:43.614 --> 00:09:46.876
I came here to be a real nurse.

00:09:47.026 --> 00:09:48.551
Wake up, Candy!

00:09:54.959 --> 00:09:58.254
Everything will be in vain
if I don't pass the test.

00:09:58.404 --> 00:10:00.259
I have to pass the test!

00:10:14.879 --> 00:10:18.874
Lungs consist
of the bronchi and the alveoli.

00:10:19.024 --> 00:10:22.779
Bronchi deliver oxygen
to the alveoli.

00:10:22.954 --> 00:10:26.715
Alveoli deal
with the exchange of oxygen.

00:10:58.256 --> 00:11:01.890
Good morning Mr. Albert.
How are you feeling?

00:11:04.862 --> 00:11:07.189
I have been quite busy lately.

00:11:07.339 --> 00:11:10.026
I am sorry that
I can't look after you like before.

00:11:10.276 --> 00:11:11.891
That's alright.

00:11:13.704 --> 00:11:16.798
Here, your favourite chestnuts.

00:11:24.315 --> 00:11:28.376
Mr. Albert doesn't seem
to be recovering.

00:11:29.153 --> 00:11:31.747
Mr. Albert,
just hold on for a few more days.

00:11:31.897 --> 00:11:33.582
After I pass my test,

00:11:33.732 --> 00:11:36.319
I will be taking care of you.

00:11:37.561 --> 00:11:42.424
I don't seem to be
quite welcomed in this hospital.

00:11:42.874 --> 00:11:44.593
Why?

00:11:44.743 --> 00:11:47.596
We treat all patients the same.

00:11:47.746 --> 00:11:50.132
There is no bias.

00:11:50.282 --> 00:11:51.667
No, Candy.

00:11:51.817 --> 00:11:54.403
I am grateful
that you have been good to me.

00:11:54.853 --> 00:11:57.006
Don't say that, Mr. Albert!

00:11:57.848 --> 00:12:02.411
I used to stay in a substandard
hospital in Italy.

00:12:02.561 --> 00:12:05.247
I lost my memory and
it's not known who I am.

00:12:05.397 --> 00:12:07.313
I'll never get any respect.

00:12:08.792 --> 00:12:12.154
You will remember everything
after you will recover.

00:12:12.304 --> 00:12:14.696
You just have
to take good care of yourself.

00:12:16.533 --> 00:12:19.595
It's better that you stay away
from a hopeless patient.

00:12:19.745 --> 00:12:21.668
I might as well die here.

00:12:22.639 --> 00:12:24.470
Mr. Albert!

00:12:26.677 --> 00:12:30.738
Mr. Albert just won't rally himself
no matter what I do.

00:12:32.549 --> 00:12:36.417
And Mr. Albert used to be
such a bright man!

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:40.287
But now...

00:12:49.466 --> 00:12:51.191
See you later.

00:12:55.472 --> 00:12:58.441
I must help him recover!

00:12:58.642 --> 00:13:01.036
In order to look after him,

00:13:01.186 --> 00:13:03.477
I have to pass the test.

00:13:05.015 --> 00:13:08.416
Only I can save Mr. Albert now!

00:13:38.081 --> 00:13:40.982
Terry, good luck with the audition!

00:13:41.317 --> 00:13:45.481
I will work hard for the
nurse qualification test as well.

00:14:12.415 --> 00:14:14.421
Adjust the lights!

00:14:14.571 --> 00:14:17.816
- Is this alright?
- A bit more!

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.357
Aren't you Miss Eleanor Baker?

00:14:26.596 --> 00:14:28.957
Please don't tell anyone.

00:14:29.107 --> 00:14:30.492
I understand.

00:14:30.642 --> 00:14:33.695
Does your son know you are here?

00:14:33.845 --> 00:14:36.500
No, I didn't tell Terrius.

00:14:45.281 --> 00:14:47.647
Come here, all of you.

00:14:50.253 --> 00:14:51.312
Ok!

00:14:51.462 --> 00:14:54.464
The audition for Romeo and Juliet
starts now.

00:15:00.663 --> 00:15:06.422
Listen,
I hope all of you try your best.

00:15:06.572 --> 00:15:08.794
Everyone, good luck!

00:15:08.944 --> 00:15:12.807
Firstly, we have Harry Grant
as Romeo.

00:15:13.443 --> 00:15:14.876
Yes.

00:15:16.079 --> 00:15:18.707
Susanna Marlowe as Juliet.

00:15:19.415 --> 00:15:22.110
Shouldn't it be Terrius?

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.179
If Terrius was my partner,

00:15:24.329 --> 00:15:25.995
I would be doing much better.

00:15:26.145 --> 00:15:28.650
Stop complaining, Susanna.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.818
Yes, I know.

00:15:36.199 --> 00:15:37.962
All right, let's start!

00:15:46.542 --> 00:15:49.103
He jests at scars

00:15:49.253 --> 00:15:52.113
That never felt a wound.

00:15:53.449 --> 00:15:54.916
But soft!

00:15:55.084 --> 00:15:57.609
what light through yonder window breaks?

00:16:02.825 --> 00:16:04.385
It is the east,

00:16:04.535 --> 00:16:06.724
and Juliet is the sun.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:09.590
Arise, fair sun,

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.492
and kill the envious moon,

00:16:12.642 --> 00:16:14.830
Who is already sick and pale with grief,

00:16:15.538 --> 00:16:18.666
That thou, her maid,
art far more fair than she.

00:16:30.286 --> 00:16:32.647
I must get this role

00:16:32.797 --> 00:16:34.952
and invite Candy over.

00:16:35.491 --> 00:16:38.317
No, I need to stay focused.

00:16:39.562 --> 00:16:43.123
I should repeat once more my lines.

00:16:47.069 --> 00:16:49.397
O Romeo, Romeo!

00:16:49.547 --> 00:16:51.702
wherefore art thou Romeo?

00:16:52.708 --> 00:16:56.470
Deny thy father and refuse thy name;

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.739
Or, if thou wilt not,

00:16:58.989 --> 00:17:01.975
be but sworn my love,

00:17:03.118 --> 00:17:07.517
And I'll no longer be a Capulet.

00:17:23.472 --> 00:17:25.201
Next.

00:17:25.808 --> 00:17:29.403
You guys are too nervous. Relax!

00:17:29.853 --> 00:17:33.175
Romeo, Terrius G. Grandchester.

00:17:33.783 --> 00:17:34.875
Yes.

00:17:35.184 --> 00:17:37.644
Juliet, Karen Clairs.

00:17:45.995 --> 00:17:47.485
You can do it, Terry!

00:17:52.902 --> 00:17:54.426
He looks so serious.

00:18:07.082 --> 00:18:10.074
I wonder how Terry’s audition is going.

00:18:12.154 --> 00:18:13.621
Candy...

00:18:15.257 --> 00:18:17.284
What are you thinking about, Candy?

00:18:17.434 --> 00:18:18.886
Nothing.

00:18:19.036 --> 00:18:21.691
How's it going?
You have any confidence?

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.824
Not until I have tried.

00:18:23.974 --> 00:18:25.791
Right.

00:18:26.001 --> 00:18:29.430
It's lucky to have the test
in the hospital.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.097
I won't get too nervous.

00:18:33.475 --> 00:18:35.670
Actually, I am nervous.

00:18:36.144 --> 00:18:38.669
My legs are shaking.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.018
The test starts now.

00:18:51.627 --> 00:18:53.117
At last!

00:18:54.262 --> 00:18:56.328
I will pass down the papers.

00:19:09.844 --> 00:19:12.074
I must pass this test.

00:19:12.314 --> 00:19:14.140
For Mr. Albert.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:19.118
I hope I could accept
Terry's invitation as a real nurse.

00:19:20.789 --> 00:19:23.087
How camest thou hither,
tell me, and wherefore?

00:19:23.558 --> 00:19:26.419
The orchard walls are high
and hard to climb,

00:19:26.569 --> 00:19:31.091
And the place death, considering who thou art,
If any of my kinsmen find thee here.

00:19:31.241 --> 00:19:34.966
With love's light wings
did I o'er-perch these walls;

00:19:35.437 --> 00:19:38.895
For stony limits cannot hold love out,

00:19:39.407 --> 00:19:42.065
And what love can do,
that dares love attempt;

00:19:42.215 --> 00:19:47.041
Therefore thy kinsmen are no stop to me.

00:19:47.515 --> 00:19:50.644
If they do see thee, they will murder thee.

00:19:50.794 --> 00:19:54.180
Alack, there lies

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:58.351
more peril in thine eye

00:19:59.327 --> 00:20:02.155
Than twenty of their swords!

00:20:02.305 --> 00:20:04.291
Look thou but sweet,

00:20:04.441 --> 00:20:06.129
And I am proof against their enmity.

00:20:06.368 --> 00:20:07.767
I would not

00:20:08.236 --> 00:20:11.131
for the world they saw thee here.

00:20:11.281 --> 00:20:13.900
I have night's cloak

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:15.602
to hide me from their sight;

00:20:16.111 --> 00:20:19.172
And but thou love me,

00:20:19.322 --> 00:20:22.273
let them find me here:

00:20:24.686 --> 00:20:27.180
My life were better ended by their hate,

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:31.016
Than death prorogued, wanting of thy love.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.985
By whose direction
found'st thou out this place?

00:20:34.763 --> 00:20:36.663
By love,

00:20:38.666 --> 00:20:40.860
who first did prompt me to inquire;
He lent me counsel

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.664
and I lent him eyes.
I am no pilot; yet, wert thou as far

00:20:42.871 --> 00:20:45.704
As that vast shore
wash'd with the farthest sea...

00:20:59.987 --> 00:21:03.623
Candy is in Chicago,
Terry is in New York.

00:21:04.125 --> 00:21:05.785
The two of them are separated
in two places.

00:21:05.935 --> 00:21:10.194
They are facing different challenges
for their own lives.
